namespace x
individuals user, message
primitive system

[A]
When a user sends a message, the system shall store the message.

scenario NEVER:
    given a user U1, a message M1
    at 0 ms: U1 sends M1.
    at 10 minutes: U1 sends M1.
    expect forbidden

scenario LATER:
    given a user U1, a message M1
    at 0 ms: U1 sends M1.
    at 10 minutes: the system stores M1.
    expect allowed
